  unitName: Frozen Blade Colt
  unitId: 20574
  unitNumber: 886
  description: One of the sacred Guardians of Meirith, who worshipped the Holy Emperor
    Karna Masta in the La Veda Republic. He is the younger twin brother of Claire,
    who also served as a Guardian. Taking great pride in being chosen by the gods
    themselves, Colt was always abrasive, but said to be gentle to the defenseless.
    He had a strong dislike for Quaid, another one of the Guardians. However, it
    is speculated that these feelings came as a form of jealousy that sprouted from
    the deep bond he shared with his twin sister. Curiously, he was also known to
    dislike small animals.
  summonDesc: You unworthy thing summoned me here?<br>I don't have a choice, so I'll
    stay,<br>but don't get any ideas.
  fusionDesc: You don't need to tell me I'm strong.<br>I already knew that.<br>You
    got anything else to say?
